                              2 ; Word pointer table (max words 256)
                              3 ; Set X to the pointer ID and call PR_WORD
                              4 ; -----------------------------------------------------
                              5 ; To create new wordk add the word in the correct
                              6 ; (alphabetical) position in the word table. Then add
                              7 ; a pointer to that word at the END of the Word Pointer
                              8 ; table. Finally add an equate (.equ) using the word as a label
                              9 ; in the word equates table;
